Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:29:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] A worker who joins is emailed only by the register's
 readiness invitation, and everyone else gets a thank-you with no link

Joining no longer ends in Mighty Networks. The register now invites workers
into the readiness portal, so this endpoint stops minting confirmation links:
workers get nothing from here, other audiences a short note with no link.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WBw8oF9rXofvLwxjHWqDZy
